    <li data-correct="true" data-why="yfinance serves roughly the last 7 days of 1-minute bars — the CLI help says so explicitly. Use 5m+ for longer lookbacks.">yfinance only provides ~7 days of 1-minute history</li>
    <li data-correct="false" data-why="No such gate exists; the limit is the data source's.">A repo setting blocks intervals under 5m</li>
    <li data-correct="false" data-why="Alpha Vantage is the NEWS source; prices come from yfinance.">Alpha Vantage rate limits</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="feedback" hidden></p>
</div>

<div class="question" data-question>
