    <li data-correct="true" data-why="exec_dry_var = BooleanVar(value=True): checked (simulate) by default. Unticking it is the GUI equivalent of rh-exec --no_dry_run — real Robinhood orders with your RH_* credentials.">Checked by default; unticking sends REAL orders via Robinhood</li>
